kz: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_pi , x0 +: x1 +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t = ⟨ kc_pi , x2 +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_eeqv x0 x2 ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_eeqv x1 x3 ∈ lrel2 ⇒ kc_pi ∈ kstr $ by kstr_pi
